  "summary": "IT System Administrator with experience building secure, scalable, and high-performance IT environments across on-prem and hybrid infrastructures. Specializes in enterprise networking, firewall architecture, identity and access management, virtualization, and endpoint security across modern IT stacks.\n\nExpertise includes Juniper switching, Palo Alto firewalls, EVPN-VXLAN campus fabric design, VPN and network segmentation, Windows and Linux server administration, VMware vSphere/vSAN, and cloud identity with Azure Entra ID and Microsoft Intune. Strong focus on improving security posture through layered controls, endpoint protection (EDR/MFA), conditional access, and compliance-aligned security practices.",
